Subject: Declare the component-manager dependency of the SDK benchmark

Applies to: RCR rclcpp_components 32.0.3-1.rcr.0, test/BUILD.bazel.

Observed failure: the registered benchmark_components target cannot compile
because rclcpp_components/component_manager.hpp is unavailable. Its source
uses ComponentManager, but only the external dependency map is in deps.

Rationale and scope: add component_manager_library as a compile dependency,
matching the package's other native tests. Keep original benchmark source,
registration, dynamic dependencies and measured operations unchanged.

Verification: all seven original C++ cases and all three registered benchmark
operations pass with Cyclone DDS, --config=runtime --config=no-agnocast, and
ROS_DOMAIN_ID=118. Original sources and registered groups remain unchanged.

Upstream: this dependency is absent from the selected published overlay,
inspected 2026-11-23. No matching upstream association is recorded.
https://bazel.ros.org/modules/rclcpp_components/32.0.3-1.rcr.0/source.json

